\": 0, \"Position\": 1.0, \"SourceId\": \"e8844a25-0c9e-56cf-9bdb-bab5f9bb2a84\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 3}, \"status\": \"external-url\", \"text\": \"\", \"type\": 3}, {\"asset\": \"3a13b044-58c4-408b-8961-7e6f72f2351a.png\", \"id\": \"3a13b044-58c4-408b-8961-7e6f72f2351a\", \"location\": \"wallpaper.png\", \"name\": \"wallpaper.png\", \"owner\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2020-08-14T20:55:20.84831\", \"DataLength\": 1940742, \"FileModificationDateTime\": \"2020-08-14T20:55:20.0098521\", \"Id\": \"3a13b044-58c4-408b-8961-7e6f72f2351a\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": true, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": true, \"Location\": \"wallpaper.png\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2020-08-14T20:55:20.84831\", \"Name\": \"wallpaper.png\", \"NoteType\": 0, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"SourceType\": 1, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 1}, \"status\": \"available\", \"text\": \"\", \"type\": 1}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"3c83f2c0-900e-47e0-b3f8-38f4baae4827\", \"location\": \"Notes.md\", \"name\": \"Notes.md\", \"owner\": \"82119e7b-4453-54b0-8bec-8145299bb2ec\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2021-08-08T23:54:32.783457\", \"DataLength\": 352, \"FileModificationDateTime\": \"2021-08-14T04:06:28.66591\", \"Id\": \"3c83f2c0-900e-47e0-b3f8-38f4baae4827\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"Notes.md\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2021-08-14T04:06:28.66994\", \"Name\": \"Notes.md\", \"NoteType\": 4, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"82119e7b-4453-54b0-8bec-8145299bb2ec\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 1}, \"status\": \"available\", \"text\": \"* \\u201cIf all the girls attending [the Yale prom] were laid end to end, I wouldn't be at all surprised.\\u201d Dorothy Parker, which Bob loved to repeat\\n* Catholic Contraceptives\\n* Clumsy oaf!\\n* Do it neatly \\u2013 slob.\\n* Fuck off, he explained\\n* Get stuffed.\\n* RSX-11SMD Small Medium Damnbig\\n* Don't visualize \\u2013 visualization is not for beginners\\n* Slob!\", \"type\": 1}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"3cbc2024-c75b-41b3-b539-d56fccf8e783\", \"location\": \"Notes.md\", \"name\": \"Notes.md\", \"owner\": \"4b098b05-e50e-4285-91ee-ce17b33f32f6\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2020-08-28T05:47:43.248765\", \"DataLength\": 94, \"FileModificationDateTime\": \"2020-08-28T05:47:43.248608\", \"Id\": \"3cbc2024-c75b-41b3-b539-d56fccf8e783\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"Notes.md\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2020-08-28T05:47:43.248766\", \"Name\": \"Notes.md\", \"NoteType\": 4, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"4b098b05-e50e-4285-91ee-ce17b33f32f6\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 1}, \"status\": \"available\", \"text\": \"good thing my dad taught me how to solder because for quite a while I was making our cables\", \"type\": 1}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"3e5dd97e-1372-482f-ad60-1b1ca36a0977\", \"location\": \"Notes.md\", \"name\": \"Notes.md\", \"owner\": \"9c4823dd-371d-4a2a-876b-232af3082d19\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2026-06-20T20:55:58.655392\", \"DataLength\": 102, \"FileModificationDateTime\": \"2026-06-20T20:55:58.655389\", \"Id\": \"3e5dd97e-1372-482f-ad60-1b1ca36a0977\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"Notes.md\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2026-06-20T20:55:58.655392\", \"Name\": \"Notes.md\", \"NoteType\": 4, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"9c4823dd-371d-4a2a-876b-232af3082d19\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"Type\": 1}, \"status\": \"available\", \"text\": \"Proc. 4th Intl. Conf. on Software Engineering. Munich, Germany, IEEE; ACM-SIGSOFT; 1979 September.\\n\", \"type\": 1}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"40881075-5999-5865-8273-e0e2425f5a68\", \"location\": \"notes.html\", \"name\": \"notes.html\", \"owner\": \"fa02e474-5562-568c-88a2-e9ae80d92dd8\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2016-08-15T02:56:03.588\", \"DataLength\": 42, \"Id\": \"40881075-5999-5865-8273-e0e2425f5a68\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"notes.html\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2016-08-15T02:56:03.588\", \"NoteType\": 2, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"fa02e474-5562-568c-88a2-e9ae80d92dd8\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 4}, \"status\": \"available\", \"text\": \"he made sure to wear a Mao jacket\", \"type\": 4}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"4393ee16-573c-4326-a15e-685b2b70ed14\", \"location\": \"Notes.md\", \"name\": \"Notes.md\", \"owner\": \"2ba4037e-c298-4760-a7d7-c57381a30c04\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2026-01-20T19:07:40.437993\", \"DataLength\": 23, \"FileModificationDateTime\": \"2026-01-20T19:07:40.437989\", \"Id\": \"4393ee16-573c-4326-a15e-685b2b70ed14\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"Notes.md\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2026-01-20T19:07:40.437994\", \"Name\": \"Notes.md\", \"NoteType\": 4, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"2ba4037e-c298-4760-a7d7-c57381a30c04\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"Type\": 1}, \"status\": \"available\", \"text\": \"19-jan-26 or before\\n\", \"type\": 1}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"4561cd7a-1f65-5fde-984f-c4278d045519\", \"location\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alvy_Ray_Smith\", \"name\": \"wikipedia\", \"owner\": \"edf979d5-5911-5cc9-8194-d0fd3a3330d8\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2017-08-09T19:31:15.53\", \"DataLength\": 0, \"Format\": \"\", \"Id\": \"4561cd7a-1f65-5fde-984f-c4278d045519\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alvy_Ray_Smith\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2020-12-06T00:51:28.508852\", \"Name\": \"wikipedia\", \"NoteType\": 0, \"Position\": 1.0, \"SourceId\": \"edf979d5-5911-5cc9-8194-d0fd3a3330d8\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 3}, \"status\": \"external-url\", \"text\": \"\", \"type\": 3}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"46e0a9d5-6a20-55e1-b393-9314248e0af0\", \"location\": \"notes.html\", \"name\": \"notes.html\", \"owner\": \"f80b2236-99d2-5485-b1ff-fc514e825afd\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2016-07-20T02:34:48.803\", \"DataLength\": 86, \"Id\": \"46e0a9d5-6a20-55e1-b393-9314248e0af0\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"notes.html\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2016-07-20T02:34:48.803\", \"NoteType\": 2, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"f80b2236-99d2-5485-b1ff-fc514e825afd\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 4}, \"status\": \"available\", \"text\": \"The JPL Hiking and Backpacking and Cross Country Skiing and Wine Tasting Club\", \"type\": 4}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"4e112c21-de00-5f66-87a6-fa2ce40abcba\", \"location\": \"/Users/jeg/Documents/JPL history project/CGL timeline.aeonxml\", \"name\": \"CGL timeline.aeonxml\", \"owner\": \"f8d850d6-2a00-590a-9956-5f3b73eae42c\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2016-07-20T02:58:24.088\", \"DataLength\": 18802, \"FileModificationDateTime\": \"2016-07-20T01:06:54\", \"Format\": \".aeonxml\", \"Id\": \"4e112c21-de00-5f66-87a6-fa2ce40abcba\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"/Users/jeg/Documents/JPL history project/CGL timeline.aeonxml\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2016-07-20T02:58:24.088\", \"Name\": \"CGL timeline.aeonxml\", \"NoteType\": 0, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"f8d850d6-2a00-590a-9956-5f3b73eae42c\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 2}, \"status\": \"unavailable\", \"text\": \"\", \"type\": 2}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"4f18ce1e-0fb7-5fd3-8039-9a3f8247971b\", \"location\": \"https://youtu.be/ctvLmjonqyE\", \"name\": \"SIGGRAPH 2017 History of the JPL Computer Graphics Lab\", \"owner\": \"98e6557a-edb1-56f0-bd0c-67c5cd23f189\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2018-06-13T04:47:33.979\", \"DataLength\": 0, \"Format\": \"\", \"Id\": \"4f18ce1e-0fb7-5fd3-8039-9a3f8247971b\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"https://youtu.be/ctvLmjonqyE\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2018-06-13T04:47:36.176\", \"Name\": \"SIGGRAPH 2017 History of the JPL Computer Graphics Lab\", \"NoteType\": 0, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"98e6557a-edb1-56f0-bd0c-67c5cd23f189\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 3, \"VideoHtml\": \"<iframe width='100%' height='100%' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/ctvLmjonqyE?start=0' frameborder='0'></iframe>\"}, \"status\": \"external-url\", \"text\": \"\", \"type\": 3}, {\"asset\": \"50b4a696-2b23-4020-9427-b08a31c7c48b.png\", \"id\": \"50b4a696-2b23-4020-9427-b08a31c7c48b\", \"location\": \"Icon.png\", \"name\": \"Icon.png\", \"owner\": \"30a48366-f441-5418-9e42-cfb2bc572eab\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2020-08-14T20:55:20.671639\", \"DataLength\": 4673, \"FileModificationDateTime\": \"2020-08-14T20:55:20.0137673\", \"Id\": \"50b4a696-2b23-4020-9427-b08a31c7c48b\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": true, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"Icon.png\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2020-08-14T20:55:20.671639\", \"Name\": \"Icon.png\", \"NoteType\": 0, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"30a48366-f441-5418-9e42-cfb2bc572eab\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 5}, \"status\": \"available\", \"text\": \"\", \"type\": 5}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"5616e587-124c-5c31-81c7-ec5ef6a0cc81\", \"location\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jim_Blinn\", \"name\": \"wikipedia\", \"owner\": \"4f7d9d83-e87f-5b53-b4fe-d003405586d2\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2017-08-09T19:26:28.376\", \"DataLength\": 0, \"Format\": \"\", \"Id\": \"5616e587-124c-5c31-81c7-ec5ef6a0cc81\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jim_Blinn\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2020-08-28T05:48:18.084637\", \"Name\": \"wikipedia\", \"NoteType\": 0, \"Position\": 1.0, \"SourceId\": \"4f7d9d83-e87f-5b53-b4fe-d003405586d2\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 3}, \"status\": \"external-url\", \"text\": \"\", \"type\": 3}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"5dad4d8f-8559-5bcc-a14b-4fd4fde1e234\", \"location\": \"notes.html\", \"name\": \"notes.html\", \"owner\": \"4169bdf5-bb51-58c3-8408-b108bed3a3c5\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2017-03-14T05:23:53\", \"DataLength\": 950, \"Id\": \"5dad4d8f-8559-5bcc-a14b-4fd4fde1e234\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"notes.html\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2017-04-17T03:06:02.605\", \"NoteType\": 2, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"4169bdf5-bb51-58c3-8408-b108bed3a3c5\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 4}, \"status\": \"available\", \"text\": \"I had to learn how an actual galaxy works. To my dismay I learned that a star went supernova about once every thousand years. What this meant for my simulation was that it would change everything. I knew that Sagan and everybody else expected the graphic to be a fairly accurate spiral of a great many point spots (the stars) spinning slowly and majestically for a few seconds. A galaxy is a truly monstrous thing. If I sped up time sufficiently that the galaxy spun solemnly during those few seconds, then the number of supernovas going off would make the galaxy sparkle. The thought of trying to explain this to Sagan, getting him to rewrite the (one-line) script, and still delivering the piece on time daunted me. So much so that I buried the glittering supernova vision and delivered (with much help from Blinn) the desired staid but majestic spiral galaxy. I wish I had stuck with the supernova version. Nobody has done it yet I think.\", \"type\": 4}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"5e44b823-ff70-5bb4-acab-cfda036ea82f\", \"location\": \"https://www.nasa.gov/image-feature/ames/40-years-ago-pioneer-venus-multiprobe-launched-to-study-the-cloud-shrouded-planet\", \"name\": \"nasa\", \"owner\": \"8570a1b2-e2b6-52cf-ba18-db172f4e05ce\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2018-09-01T06:10:03\", \"DataLength\": 0, \"Format\": \"\", \"Id\": \"5e44b823-ff70-5bb4-acab-cfda036ea82f\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"https://www.nasa.gov/image-feature/ames/40-years-ago-pioneer-venus-multiprobe-launched-to-study-the-cloud-shrouded-planet\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2018-09-01T06:10:03\", \"Name\": \"nasa\", \"NoteType\": 0, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"8570a1b2-e2b6-52cf-ba18-db172f4e05ce\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 3}, \"status\": \"external-url\", \"text\": \"\", \"type\": 3}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"69970848-bbff-44fc-a30c-ac598f301ef6\", \"location\": \"http://jimblinn.com\", \"name\": \"jimblinn\", \"owner\": \"4f7d9d83-e87f-5b53-b4fe-d003405586d2\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2021-07-30T18:55:24.401286\", \"DataLength\": 0, \"Id\": \"69970848-bbff-44fc-a30c-ac598f301ef6\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"http://jimblinn.com\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2021-07-30T18:55:25.024149\", \"Name\": \"jimblinn\", \"NoteType\": 0, \"Position\": 2.0, \"SourceId\": \"4f7d9d83-e87f-5b53-b4fe-d003405586d2\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 3}, \"status\": \"external-url\", \"text\": \"\", \"type\": 3}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"6a9e050c-bb7f-47e4-9dd6-b766b79aebee\", \"location\": \"Notes.md\", \"name\": \"Notes.md\", \"owner\": \"0417b7a8-f5bd-4945-9a72-d5e492eb7a49\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2020-09-09T23:32:54.598379\", \"DataLength\": 254, \"FileModificationDateTime\": \"2020-09-09T23:34:17.68668\", \"Id\": \"6a9e050c-bb7f-47e4-9dd6-b766b79aebee\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"Notes.md\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2020-09-09T23:34:17.688122\", \"Name\": \"Notes.md\", \"NoteType\": 4, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"0417b7a8-f5bd-4945-9a72-d5e492eb7a49\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 1}, \"status\": \"available\", \"text\": \"I used to sit there for hours making pictures of armor plated pickles and brick spheres. I had no idea I was abusing the vanguard of computer graphics, but \\u2026 actually, no. I was doing experimentation in the line of duty, so it was completely proper.\", \"type\": 1}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"6fa8dd4f-9204-5cf5-baaf-4a2c7a366ce7\", \"location\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charles_Kohlhase\", \"name\": \"wikipedia\", \"owner\": \"40dd2d93-3b5f-5be3-9b7a-15735a3dc31e\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2017-08-09T19:27:43.851\", \"DataLength\": 0, \"Format\": \"\", \"Id\": \"6fa8dd4f-9204-5cf5-baaf-4a2c7a366ce7\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charles_Kohlhase\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2021-07-23T04:21:24.861962\", \"Name\": \"wikipedia\", \"NoteType\": 0, \"Position\": 1.0, \"SourceId\": \"40dd2d93-3b5f-5be3-9b7a-15735a3dc31e\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 3}, \"status\": \"external-url\", \"text\": \"\", \"type\": 3}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"701b9fac-c919-5def-8fd4-844f2bbb37a5\", \"location\": \"notes.html\", \"name\": \"notes.html\", \"owner\": \"2687f8f7-6a86-5d72-a403-40343d86af48\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2016-08-15T02:56:22.383\", \"DataLength\": 23, \"Id\": \"701b9fac-c919-5def-8fd4-844f2bbb37a5\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"notes.html\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2016-08-15T02:56:22.383\", \"NoteType\": 2, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"2687f8f7-6a86-5d72-a403-40343d86af48\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 4}, \"status\": \"available\", \"text\": \"was it 1 or 2?\", \"type\": 4}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"7273704c-81f0-5010-8f92-24bdb2abbdf3\", \"location\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/David_DiFrancesco\", \"name\": \"wikipedia\", \"owner\": \"3a4b6757-d8f5-5b04-91a2-f2fee95187f7\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2017-08-09T19:31:57.327\", \"DataLength\": 0, \"Format\": \"\", \"Id\": \"7273704c-81f0-5010-8f92-24bdb2abbdf3\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/David_DiFrancesco\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2017-08-09T19:31:57.327\", \"Name\": \"wikipedia\", \"NoteType\": 0, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"3a4b6757-d8f5-5b04-91a2-f2fee95187f7\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 3}, \"status\": \"external-url\", \"text\": \"\", \"type\": 3}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"74d0cb07-6fa9-47b3-9cc9-306948d8c774\", \"location\": \"https://www.legacy.com/us/obituaries/mercurynews/name/patricia-prince-obituary?pid=198510511\", \"name\": \"www.legacy.com\", \"owner\": \"7b64cd05-c4c9-413a-8e7c-2cfc7ba4b149\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2021-08-09T00:22:48.273862\", \"DataLength\": 0, \"Id\": \"74d0cb07-6fa9-47b3-9cc9-306948d8c774\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"https://www.legacy.com/us/obituaries/mercurynews/name/patricia-prince-obituary?pid=198510511\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2021-08-09T00:22:48.62338\", \"Name\": \"www.legacy.com\", \"NoteType\": 0, \"Position\": 1.0, \"SourceId\": \"7b64cd05-c4c9-413a-8e7c-2cfc7ba4b149\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 3}, \"status\": \"external-url\", \"text\": \"\", \"type\": 3}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"7726be22-44a9-4506-9bef-c6b08043e4b1\", \"location\": \"Notes.md\", \"name\": \"Notes.md\", \"owner\": \"c04ee118-8bca-49f6-8f96-3a5b2689bbe0\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2022-05-06T02:47:16.944412\", \"DataLength\": 70, \"FileModificationDateTime\": \"2022-05-06T02:47:16.944267\", \"Id\": \"7726be22-44a9-4506-9bef-c6b08043e4b1\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"Notes.md\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2022-05-06T02:47:16.944413\", \"Name\": \"Notes.md\", \"NoteType\": 4, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"c04ee118-8bca-49f6-8f96-3a5b2689bbe0\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 1}, \"status\": \"available\", \"text\": \"how I animated the attitudes of the spacecraft and the solar arrays\", \"type\": 1}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"79d02dd6-e5d9-5908-a7e0-9e2505d0de74\", \"location\": \"http://jplgraphicslab.org\", \"name\": \"NASA JPL computer graphics lab\", \"owner\": \"6b8f6622-c037-54f0-9c09-b98a6c2428f0\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2018-06-13T04:49:56.428\", \"DataLength\": 0, \"Format\": \".org\", \"Id\": \"79d02dd6-e5d9-5908-a7e0-9e2505d0de74\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"http://jplgraphicslab.org\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2020-08-14T20:55:26.644459\", \"Name\": \"NASA JPL computer graphics lab\", \"NoteType\": 0, \"Position\": 1.0, \"SourceId\": \"6b8f6622-c037-54f0-9c09-b98a6c2428f0\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 3}, \"status\": \"external-url\", \"text\": \"\", \"type\": 3}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"7ddfb8d0-944c-45e8-ad0d-08b62611bb6e\", \"location\": \"Notes.md\", \"name\": \"Notes.md\", \"owner\": \"ce32df7f-5076-423d-bfce-328f471d1f52\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2026-06-20T20:55:38.828271\", \"DataLength\": 40, \"FileModificationDateTime\": \"2026-06-20T20:55:38.828268\", \"Id\": \"7ddfb8d0-944c-45e8-ad0d-08b62611bb6e\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"Notes.md\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2026-06-20T20:55:38.828271\", \"Name\": \"Notes.md\", \"NoteType\": 4, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"ce32df7f-5076-423d-bfce-328f471d1f52\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"Type\": 1}, \"status\": \"available\", \"text\": \"Computer. 1980 January. Book review.\\n\", \"type\": 1}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"8069db4e-21be-519f-944a-9bf586c4c81f\", \"location\": \"notes.html\", \"name\": \"notes.html\", \"owner\": \"f2569ba4-71d1-5b10-b6a5-6d67ef6c0090\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2018-06-13T04:45:10.925\", \"DataLength\": 138, \"Id\": \"8069db4e-21be-519f-944a-9bf586c4c81f\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"notes.html\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2018-06-13T04:45:10.925\", \"NoteType\": 2, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"f2569ba4-71d1-5b10-b6a5-6d67ef6c0090\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 4}, \"status\": \"available\", \"text\": \"Society for the History of Technology and the National Aeronautics and Space Administration 2018\\u201319 Fellow in Aerospace History\", \"type\": 4}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"8184cf98-4469-5d8e-9414-76de1509793a\", \"location\": \"notes.html\", \"name\": \"notes.html\", \"owner\": \"9fad53b4-243e-5cee-9ebc-7cb006496903\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2017-03-14T05:26:53\", \"DataLength\": 836, \"Id\": \"8184cf98-4469-5d8e-9414-76de1509793a\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"notes.html\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2017-04-17T03:06:37.428\", \"NoteType\": 2, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"9fad53b4-243e-5cee-9ebc-7cb006496903\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 4}, \"status\": \"available\", \"text\": \"We prowled the JPL campus in the daytime too. David and I happened onto an amazing event in a parking lot. A group of young people was fastening a beer keg to a large dish antenna. They turned out to be Explorer Scouts doing a good deed. JPL had donated the dish antenna to them. My memory says it was 10-15 feet across, but that's not reliable. They had discovered somehow that people on Pitcairn Island needed power or fresh water or something else that the keg-dish contraption could supply using the sun. The beer keg served as a condenser I think. Yes, Pitcairn Island, where Fletcher Christian and fellow mutineers settled after the infamous Mutiny on the Bounty. These island people were their descendants. The Scouts' problem as I recall was how to get the beast to Pitcairn Island. I don't know if they ever succeeded.\", \"type\": 4}, {\"asset\": \"8a9b79c1-69b7-4318-9cce-6a883b32c638.png\", \"id\": \"8a9b79c1-69b7-4318-9cce-6a883b32c638\", \"location\": \"Icon.png\", \"name\": \"Icon.png\", \"owner\": \"024c2808-59f5-5341-9843-937aec12fc69\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2020-08-14T20:55:20.673155\", \"DataLength\": 2962, \"FileModificationDateTime\": \"2020-08-14T20:55:20.0148205\", \"Id\": \"8a9b79c1-69b7-4318-9cce-6a883b32c638\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": true, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"Icon.png\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2020-08-14T20:55:20.673155\", \"Name\": \"Icon.png\", \"NoteType\": 0, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"024c2808-59f5-5341-9843-937aec12fc69\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 5}, \"status\": \"available\", \"text\": \"\", \"type\": 5}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"8ae19ae0-e78e-55d1-b223-e8971d1a8bcf\", \"location\": \"https://spectrum.ieee.org/computing/hardware/why-the-future-of-data-storage-is-still-magnetic-tape\", \"name\": \"ieee\", \"owner\": \"14f0c3ad-089a-5f3b-b138-80fa41f54eaa\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2018-09-02T05:08:08\", \"DataLength\": 0, \"Format\": \"\", \"Id\": \"8ae19ae0-e78e-55d1-b223-e8971d1a8bcf\", \"IsAiScriptsFil