1-1a5621fb0ccf\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": true, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"Icon.png\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2020-08-14T20:55:20.670372\", \"Name\": \"Icon.png\", \"NoteType\": 0, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"62ac9ae2-ce0f-5d52-952e-a906980209f9\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 5}, \"status\": \"available\", \"text\": \"\", \"type\": 5}, {\"asset\": \"c169409b-ffbb-41c9-8c27-2b9ef04fe60c.png\", \"id\": \"c169409b-ffbb-41c9-8c27-2b9ef04fe60c\", \"location\": \"Icon.png\", \"name\": \"Icon.png\", \"owner\": \"6b2ccff5-addb-5109-ba7d-dc5bf6581cbd\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2020-08-14T20:55:20.670795\", \"DataLength\": 3109, \"FileModificationDateTime\": \"2020-08-14T20:55:20.0131017\", \"Id\": \"c169409b-ffbb-41c9-8c27-2b9ef04fe60c\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": true, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"Icon.png\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2020-08-14T20:55:20.670795\", \"Name\": \"Icon.png\", \"NoteType\": 0, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"6b2ccff5-addb-5109-ba7d-dc5bf6581cbd\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 5}, \"status\": \"available\", \"text\": \"\", \"type\": 5}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"d7b4e11d-5c19-5ce3-800d-ddde2367d21f\", \"location\": \"notes.html\", \"name\": \"notes.html\", \"owner\": \"7b4a0dd4-1893-5763-b369-b1cfdf4d5561\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2017-03-14T05:26:06\", \"DataLength\": 321, \"Id\": \"d7b4e11d-5c19-5ce3-800d-ddde2367d21f\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"notes.html\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2017-04-17T03:06:21.96\", \"NoteType\": 2, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"7b4a0dd4-1893-5763-b369-b1cfdf4d5561\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 4}, \"status\": \"available\", \"text\": \"David D. and I would prowl the halls of JPL at wee times of the day. On one of these forays, we discovered a room of what looked like library card catalog trays. But each tray was filled with snapshots from the Apollo project. There were thousands of astonishing shots that the public hadn't (still hasn't) seen.\", \"type\": 4}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"d99929dd-7f46-5476-81c5-2373f99cb33e\", \"location\": \"notes.html\", \"name\": \"notes.html\", \"owner\": \"d99255d2-1c66-557f-9cb6-33a3eff9aafe\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2017-01-12T00:53:12.477\", \"DataLength\": 100, \"Id\": \"d99929dd-7f46-5476-81c5-2373f99cb33e\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"notes.html\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2017-01-12T00:53:12.477\", \"NoteType\": 2, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"d99255d2-1c66-557f-9cb6-33a3eff9aafe\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 4}, \"status\": \"available\", \"text\": \"IOM. Poor practice of only using the first initial, in addition to fact he was also in 264.\", \"type\": 4}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"de6876da-75b1-5874-bd55-a072f70c0703\", \"location\": \"notes.html\", \"name\": \"notes.html\", \"owner\": \"c57adcb7-b323-514f-897e-89fcb4ff71a6\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2017-01-03T03:25:04.318\", \"DataLength\": 50, \"Id\": \"de6876da-75b1-5874-bd55-a072f70c0703\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"notes.html\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2017-01-03T03:25:09.29\", \"NoteType\": 2, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"c57adcb7-b323-514f-897e-89fcb4ff71a6\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"Type\": 4}, \"status\": \"available\", \"text\": \"A welcome fragrance at the end of the day\", \"type\": 4}, {\"asset\": null, \"id\": \"df8b18ca-b61f-5f3d-beee-405460446844\", \"location\": \"notes.html\", \"name\": \"notes.html\", \"owner\": \"c0fb41cc-430b-501c-974c-7cf0e8d004f1\", \"raw\": {\"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2016-07-21T19:19:36.071\", \"DataLength\": 21, \"Id\": \"df8b18ca-b61f-5f3d-beee-405460446844\", \"IsAiScriptsFile\": false, \"IsBrainAttachment\": false, \"IsBrainIcon\": false, \"IsIcon\": false, \"IsKeyboardShortcutsFile\": false, \"IsToolbarConfigFile\": false, \"IsWallpaper\": false, \"Location\": \"notes.html\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2016-07-21T19:19:36.071\", \"NoteType\": 2, \"Position\": 0.0, \"SourceId\": \"c0fb41cc-430b-501c-974c-7cf0e8d004f1\", \"SourceType\": 2, \"SyncSentId\": 