, \"title\": \"Journey to the Comets\", \"topic\": \"Movie\", \"types\": [\"Movie\"], \"year\": null}, {\"citationCount\": 0, \"id\": \"7b4a0dd4-1893-5763-b369-b1cfdf4d5561\", \"kind\": 1, \"notes\": \"David D. and I would prowl the halls of JPL at wee times of the day. On one of these forays, we discovered a room of what looked like library card catalog trays. But each tray was filled with snapshots from the Apollo project. There were thousands of astonishing shots that the public hadn't (still hasn't) seen.\", \"raw\": {\"ACType\": 0, \"ActivationDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:26:53.432978\", \"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2017-03-14T05:25:50\", \"Id\": \"7b4a0dd4-1893-5763-b369-b1cfdf4d5561\", \"Kind\": 1, \"LinksModificationDateTime\": \"2017-03-15T18:59:37\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2017-03-14T05:25:50\", \"Name\": \"hidden photos from the Apollo mission\", \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"TagIds\": [], \"ThoughtIconInfo\": \"1::0:True:False:0:\", \"TypeId\": \"97dc7875-cd9c-5ad0-b94c-00967b0c39a9\"}, \"tags\": [], \"title\": \"hidden photos from the Apollo mission\", \"topic\": \"anecdote\", \"types\": [\"anecdote\"], \"year\": null}, {\"citationCount\": 0, \"id\": \"7b64cd05-c4c9-413a-8e7c-2cfc7ba4b149\", \"kind\": 1, \"notes\": \"\", \"raw\": {\"ACType\": 0, \"ActivationDateTime\": \"2021-08-09T00:22:07.339883\", \"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2021-08-09T00:22:02.703775\", \"Id\": \"7b64cd05-c4c9-413a-8e7c-2cfc7ba4b149\", \"Kind\": 1, \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2021-08-09T00:22:48.278322\", \"Name\": \"Patric Prince\", \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"TagIds\": [], \"ThoughtIconInf