{\"citationCount\": 0, \"id\": \"8194da23-cee3-54b8-9000-ffadb1ac841e\", \"kind\": 1, \"notes\": \"\", \"raw\": {\"ACType\": 0, \"ActivationDateTime\": \"2026-01-20T03:15:04.789385\", \"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2018-09-21T21:58:50.041\", \"Id\": \"8194da23-cee3-54b8-9000-ffadb1ac841e\", \"Kind\": 1, \"LinksModificationDateTime\": \"2018-09-21T21:59:33.45\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2018-09-21T21:58:50.041\", \"Name\": \"West Coast University\", \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"TagIds\": [], \"ThoughtIconInfo\": \"1::0:False:False:0:\"}, \"tags\": [], \"title\": \"West Coast University\", \"topic\": \"Unclassified\", \"types\": [], \"year\": null}, {\"citationCount\": 0, \"id\": \"81bf9057-b417-5c22-88a6-3e6bed236a9a\", \"kind\": 1, \"notes\": \"storyboard / sequencing\", \"raw\": {\"ACType\": 0, \"ActivationDateTime\": \"2016-07-22T02:12:52.526\", \"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2016-07-12T18:22:44\", \"Id\": \"81bf9057-b417-5c22-88a6-3e6bed236a9a\", \"Kind\": 1, \"LinksModificationDateTime\": \"2016-07-12T18:22:45\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2016-07-22T02:11:22.163\", \"Name\": \"1 design what would show on the screen\", \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"TagIds\": [], \"ThoughtIconInfo\": \"1::0:True:False:0:\"}, \"tags\": [], \"title\": \"1 design what would show on the screen\", \"topic\": \"Unclassified\", \"types\": [], \"year\": null}, {\"citationCount\": 0, \"id\": \"82119e7b-4453-54b0-8bec-8145299bb2ec\", \"kind\": 1, \"notes\": \"* \\u201cIf all the girls attending [the Yale prom] were laid end to end, I wouldn't be at all surprised.\\u201d Dorothy Parker, which Bob loved to repeat\\n* Catholic Contraceptives\\n* Clumsy oaf!\\n* Do it neatly \\u2013 slob.\\n* Fuck off, he explained\\n* Get stuffed.\\n* RSX-11SMD Small Medium Damnbig\\n* Don't visualize \\u2013 visualization is not for beginners\\n* Slob!\", \"raw\": {\"ACType\": 0, \"ActivationDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:26:30.336975\", \"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2016-08-04T19:31:01.672\", \"Id\": \"82119e7b-4453-54b0-8bec-8145299bb2ec\", \"Kind\": 1, \"LinksModificationDateTime\": \"2016-10-24T06:16:27.495\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2021-08-08T23:54:32.787116\", \"Name\": \"Holzmanisms\", \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"TagIds\": [], \"ThoughtIconInfo\": \"1::0:True:False:0:\"}, \"tags\": [], \"title\": \"Holzmanisms\", \"topic\": \"Unclassified\", \"types\": [], \"year\": null}, {\"citationCount\": 0, \"id\": \"848eff57-2b00-5de0-b1d2-2f0dd717d1bd\", \"kind\": 1, \"notes\": \"Because of time constraints for the panel (i.e. 90 minutes), Jim was not able to cover everything about his work. This video is the 2nd half of his presentation.\", \"raw\": {\"ACType\": 0, \"ActivationDateTime\": \"2018-06-13T04:49:07.243\", \"BrainId\": \"ebe741c3-71fe-005e-0a17-062a53c5f110\", \"CreationDateTime\": \"2017-09-28T03:24:30.091\", \"Id\": \"848eff57-2b00-5de0-b1d2-2f0dd717d1bd\", \"Kind\": 1, \"LinksModificationDateTime\": \"2017-09-28T03:24:30.109\", \"ModificationDateTime\": \"2018-06-13T04:49:10.281\", \"Name\": \"c) Panel 2nd Half\", \"SyncSentId\": \"0cbcc841-7929-46e1-a3af-12c9f0d0c151\", \"SyncUpdateDateTime\": \"2025-07-06T19:25:39.806487\", \"SyncUpdateId\": \"d40aca28-d443-4278-bae2-096e23692407\", \"TagIds\": [], \"ThoughtIconInfo\": \"1::0:True:False:0:\"}, \"tags\": [], \"title\": \"c) Panel 2nd Half\", \"topic\": \"Unclassified\", \"types\": [], \"year\": null}, {\"citationCount\": 0, \